{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14303064","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14303064","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1430306401:1":{"text":"잔인함은 상대적인 거지. 퀸 성하께서 저들에게 자비를 베푸시는 건 오히려 우리에게 잔인한 일이야!","source_cn":"残忍只是相对的，她对于这些乱民仁慈，那就是对我们残忍！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8E44BDA617CFEA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430306402:1":{"text":"퀸 성하께서 옳은 일을 하신 거야. 모든 죄악을 씻어내야 셀로클랜드가 평화로워질 테니까.","source_cn":"我支持奎茵冕下的做法，只有清除所有的罪恶，萨洛克兰才会安宁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x785E1A457342E1B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族莫瑞":{"text":"귀족 모레이","source":"贵族莫瑞","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:贵族凯尔顿":{"text":"귀족 칼튼","source":"贵族凯尔顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}}